{"id":5112,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":514,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"混乱的战场出现了一丝间隙，你向前冲去，3个污秽的怪物向你扑来。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"options":["滚开！"],"jump":[4],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"右手爆发出剧烈的赤光，你用权能将敌人轰成碎屑，面前淤堵的污染也被轰出破洞。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"强制发动的副作用立刻出现，但你无暇顾及，冲进谈判大厅——","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"尖刺穿透她的身体，像已经结束的残酷行刑。卓娅垂着头，对你的闯入没有做出任何反应。","style":3,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"……别……碰我…………我……不是…………","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"她双目失神，低语着，声音沙哑，砸向地面的拳头早已绽裂。狂厄同时伤害着她的身体与意志。你知道她还在战斗，跟侵入她意识的污秽拼死战斗。","style":3,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"options":["卓娅，我来了……"],"jump":[12],"style":6,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"voice":["vo_cgplot_5112010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":18,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"别想……别想赢……我不会输的……不会……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"options":["卓娅，我来跟你一起战斗了"],"jump":[14],"style":6,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"你向她伸手，想用枷锁唤醒她。","style":3,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"可就在这时，卓娅猛地抬头，双眼燃烧着紫色的火焰，杀意瞬间将你吞噬。","style":3,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"别碰我——滚开！！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"你胸口被重重一击，连带着向后被击飞了好几米，被梦魇接住的时候，你吐出一口血来。","style":3,"background":50504,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"在模糊的视野中，你看到粘附在她右肩膀上的濡湿状的异质之物，几乎是同时，你也有了一种被它凝视的感觉。","style":3,"background":50505,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>她是……我的……她想要的，我能给……！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112017"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":50505,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？","content":"呵呵，就是这样……战斗吧，卓娅……摧毁眼前的一切，战斗不止……这就是你力量的本源，也是你最真实的一面……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112019"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"？？","content":"它所渴望的，就是这样的你……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5112020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}